[{"title":"冬夜八首 其七","author":"黄文仪","text":"江星云外落，海日地中来。\n水碧浮天镜，霞红照玉台。\n几株枫树雪，数朵陇头梅。\n报晓钟初击，霜寒落叶豗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3660,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬夜八首 其八","author":"黄文仪","text":"雪黏千树白，霜染一林红。\n星落花垂露，更残雾捲风。\n板桥苔路滑，海屿日华融。\n世界劳生事，乾坤任转蓬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3661,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"一窗冷雨裁诗夜，半壁青灯立雪时。\n风送涛声来枕畔，烟笼春色上梅枝。\n茶烹活水珠跳急，炉爇名香雾袅迟。\n醉意陶陶聊自适，琛情间寄几行诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3662,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"黄花无语解含嚬，绿酒多情惯醉人。\n枕上梦魂频化蝶，壁间剑气未埋尘。\n冲霄老鹤云情在，傲雪寒梅雨意新。\n莫怪空山零落尽，霜严谁是后凋身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3663,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其三","author":"黄文仪","text":"月来日往成今古，物换星移转岁年。\n一片閒云空里色，千林落叶晚来烟。\n风光共道如流水，世界谁知似芥船。\n夜静涛声闻汩没，琴情妙入伯牙弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3664,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其四","author":"黄文仪","text":"静里方知宇宙宽，匡林梦觉意閒閒。\n逸情聊共青云远，幽兴贪看夜月团。\n山意冲寒梅破蕊，岸容带雾聊凋残。\n芳心未与年俱尽，且醉流霞待鹤还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3665,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其五","author":"黄文仪","text":"寒风吹送晚来潮，水意云情入望遥。\n雪满空山人独立，霜凝老干木初凋。\n遐心寄与云边鹤，韵事閒听月下箫。\n想到江头烟雨里，野梅应放玉千条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3666,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其六","author":"黄文仪","text":"烟锁寒山睡未醒，鸟飞绝迹悄无声。\n遥看零落疏林外，犹带苍红石发萦。\n雨雪霏霏催岁暮，梅花泛泛迫诗情。\n年来世事浑忘却，重订江鸥旧日盟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3667,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其七","author":"黄文仪","text":"倚栏日日看云行，风动疏林鹤梦惊。\n旷野萧条晨雾重，江村冷寂暮烟生。\n绿落苔枯山露骨，冰坚地冻水无声。\n铅华剥尽天涯色，松柏留青老气横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3668,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景八首 其八","author":"黄文仪","text":"潮落沙堤暮雨阑，排空雁字拂云端。\n一天冷月三冬景，两岸寒涛万顷滩。\n雪蕊散时天欲晓，霜钟声寂漏初残。\n整衣默坐鸡三唱，炉火香清爇紫檀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3669,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"桑枯木落响天风，霞彩云阴暮景中。\n树色苍苍遮不断，满江还有木芙蓉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3670,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"万象绕归仁寿镜，一尘不翳玉壶冰。\n裁成妙句偶然得，兴到研云写紫藤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3671,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景 其三","author":"黄文仪","text":"半亩塘开一鉴澄，幽人心迹冷于冰。\n山斋日日吟风坐，貌瘦神清道气凝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3672,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬景 其四","author":"黄文仪","text":"夜夜烹茶煮雪冰，今霄霁色十分澄。\n山窗坐落三更月，炉焰犹然煖气蒸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3673,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"北极 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"天地至仁万物运，运行昼夜无时阙。\n煌煌有象北辰居，宝其阳光尊日月。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3674,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"北极 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"列宿森罗皆拱北，泯乎声臭绝形色。\n浑然帝载妙无为，大哉圣心一太极。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3675,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"玉山，","author":"黄文仪","text":"万仞高峰秀出尘，芙蓉涨起海之滨。\n鸾潭碧水光于镜，玉岭晴云白似银。\n展拓晶屏二千里，烂开花木四时春。\n奇游不减蓬莱胜，窈谷幽岩曲曲津。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3676,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"一帘竹影画离离，月白风清花气吹。\n梦里似曾闻广乐，醒来玉树弄阶墀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3677,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"青松黛绿秀超群，半入江天半入云。\n地僻最宜秋鹤唳，风涛起处夜深闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3678,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景 其三","author":"黄文仪","text":"霞衣叠叠灿天青，松影森森自一亭。\n夜半月明惊鹤唳，芙蓉露下气流馨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3679,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景 其四","author":"黄文仪","text":"霜寒水落响天风，烟叶流丹几树枫。\n雪冷石梁人影绝，蓑衣独钓一渔翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3680,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扶鸾","author":"黄文仪","text":"一幅鸾书鸟篆文，空中落笔捲风云。\n每当烛跋香残后，驾鹤飞来紫气芬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3681,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜泛莲潭","author":"黄文仪","text":"月色随波涌，云阴落地流。\n水澄千里镜，天净十分秋。\n鹓鹭飞芦渚，凫鹥立浪头。\n濯缨方自适，随意泛渔舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3682,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜雨","author":"黄文仪","text":"细雨萧斋夜，寒毡冷似霜。\n地炉频煮酒，倾尽一壶觞。\n展卷翻细帙，挑灯对短章。\n文坛灵不抿，剑气吐光芒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3683,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜起 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"夜深山月一轮高，屋角阴风正怒号。\n自起开窗望明月，满庭树影弄萧骚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3684,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜起 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"匆匆扰扰几人閒，梦醒鸡声五夜阑。\n争似鸟栖深树乐，山村日暮共云还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3685,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孟冬二十九夜作","author":"黄文仪","text":"云暗风疏候，星明月晦天。\n松涛连夜响，竹树起寒烟。\n石砌虫鸣急，霜篱菊尚鲜。\n垂帘宵独坐，睡去梦魂圆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3686,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"北匪戕官后，南疆恣劫攘。\n揭竿起伏莽，乌合成鸱张。\n祭纛用人牺，顺天帜飘扬。\n蓦地纵剽掠，哀鸿目惨伤。\n将官守火库，民勇护城厢。\n蔓延苏逆来，乘时跳陆梁。\n勒金与封谷，冤惨不可当。\n大军快来苏，焚香祝上苍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3687,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"粤匪毒于贼，攻庄恣杀虏。\n列幕挂帅旂，榜起中军府。\n主帜惟李受，伟中误为辅。\n飞檄调三军，分营并设伍。\n溪南五百庄，一炬成焦土。\n我民竟何辜，风餐夜宿露。\n呼天喊地来，栖身竟无所。\n死者纷狼籍，生者犹罹苦。\n平公菩萨心，涕泣为招抚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3688,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"援兵一旅馀，时自郡南下。\n行次楠梓坑，环宿王宫社。\n一卒警梦呼，有谍来谋夜。\n起视贼纷纷，磔石浪掷瓦。\n急击枪连环，竟尔众避寡。\n彼贼固无能，神助亦非假。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3689,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"陂城一挫衄，贼兽散纷纷。\n拥兵火药库，一卒不出门。\n尔乃肆跳梁，啸聚再为群。\n村庄罄劫掠，冤声不可闻。\n举头望青天，何时见官军。\n惨兹离乱日，民命诚鸡豚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3690,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"得胜通军号，绿叶插上头。\n天寒夜昏黑，长驱过敌楼。\n如入无人境，北风鸣飕飕。\n进薄焚前署，杀声喊咻咻。\n火炮连击之，逃生无处求。\n隘巷遇民兵，飞弹红乱投。\n颠倒蒺藜内，截屠血涨沟。\n鼠窜与鹿奔，星星急散休。\n谁提一旅师，逐寇出捕搜。\n孽氛立扫净，逆竖敢稽留。\n如何再延蔓，猖獗为民忧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3691,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"县东有一境，号曰罗汉门。\n此地称粤区，贼伺为巢屯。\n陂头既败北，兔窟营孔殷。\n爰集三千旅，旌旂飏风云。\n伊谁献此策，苏逆计超群。\n扬威齐奋武，一战弃甲奔。\n乃复持两端，擒渠约官军。\n嗟嗟苏大哥，狡猾犹如鼢。\n原来豆变子，众唾不堪闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3692,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"凤姑谁家女，青楼之侠妓。\n立马提金刀，轩袖时流视。\n簇拥少年男，盎盎花粉气。\n观者列如堵，尔贼诚游戏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3693,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"秃奴敢作贼，树帜冈上殿。\n一阵袈裟兵，个个罗汉面。\n背负金观音，漫云佛助战。\n菩萨如有知，汝曹岂得免。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3694,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"畏贼陈骑尉，分垒护陂城。\n屯军北郭外，刁斗夜丁丁。\n未曾见一卒，那有贼谋营。\n发炮击投树，官军空夜惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3695,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"数间火药库，僻在城东里。\n环植竹四围，用以藏军器。\n堂堂翁游戎，潜身此依据。\n贼来不出剿，干城枉尔寄。\n藉非民勇力，逆党何由避。\n散财得民心，托公善为计。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3696,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"巨炮何年物，沈埋沙砾中。\n斑驳久韬晦，猝获称神功。\n量弹装斗馀，正苦药难供。\n百觔由郡来，一试响彻空。\n霹雳喷天花，冲突滚火龙。\n闻之皆胆落，逐寇走匆匆。\n幸哉此一隅，赖兹免粤锋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3697,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪许逆滋事五古十二首","author":"黄文仪","text":"北鄙功成后，南辕返旆时。\n盆香迎道路，父老望旌旂。\n赫赫马提军，桓桓列虎貔。\n扬威扫孽竖，鸣钲震鼓鼙。\n闻风贼股栗，一矢怕交驰。\n星散兽窜伏，执丑争戏之。\n我民素知方，先驱义勇为。\n擒渠致麾下，曾不劳王师。\n善后宜筹画，毋贻恶蔓滋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3698,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋景 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"秋来何物最关心，篱满黄花橘满林。\n一艺未成惭夙志，千诗寄意记幽音。\n奇文过眼聊成诵，奥义连篇费苦寻。\n读倦焚香欣独坐，不时悦耳听幽禽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3699,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋景 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"玉阶绿荫连枝树，金鼎香开独占兰。\n喜作坡翁两日坐，未妨康节一身閒。\n半捲疏帘邀月色，好开幽径对花欢。\n柴门静掩苔无迹，味道应须万虑删。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3700,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶兴","author":"黄文仪","text":"一帘明月裁诗夜，半榻清风独坐时。\n搁笔静观浮世事，黄粱梦觉饭犹炊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3701,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"问天","author":"黄文仪","text":"骚首沈吟问太清，人间何事不平鸣。\n几回欲洗巢由耳，飞到蓬山卧月明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3702,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"小隐隐城郭，檐前竹四帷。\n一庵花鸟趣，雅称闭门居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3703,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"万缘空了了，诗酒未忘情。\n寄兴青云外，琼楼开玉京。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3704,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其三","author":"黄文仪","text":"梦中游八极，醉里傲乾坤。\n觉悟浮生事，应知入道门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3705,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其四","author":"黄文仪","text":"太空云翳断，秋月一轮高。\n心静知缘少，诗清为兴豪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3706,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其五","author":"黄文仪","text":"诗酒含生意，都因凿窍忘。\n至人心若镜，应物绝迎将。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3707,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其六","author":"黄文仪","text":"倚筇流水外，相对暮山青。\n月照芦如雪，风吹荻一汀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3708,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其七","author":"黄文仪","text":"溪月号寒蚓，秋镜响夜虫。\n凄清缠客思，离恨郁忡忡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3709,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其八","author":"黄文仪","text":"闭户诵周易，焚香清道心。\n爻词如可会，大象何难寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3710,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其九","author":"黄文仪","text":"孤雁云边叫，啼猿月下闻。\n一声凄切调，寄意写回文。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3711,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十","author":"黄文仪","text":"太空浑不有，夜夜灿星图。\n经纬罗天地，无垣不拱枢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3712,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十一","author":"黄文仪","text":"潮汐期无爽，波涛吐纳中。\n降舛关地气，呼吸运相通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3713,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十二","author":"黄文仪","text":"月射阳精耀，星分日气光。\n至人凌倒影，夜夜月辉扬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3714,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十三","author":"黄文仪","text":"福图五十五，环极百神居。\n欲觅天门入，应观三纬书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3715,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十四","author":"黄文仪","text":"智极三天数，胸藏万卷书。\n诚明理尽彻，仰企石斋庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3716,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十五","author":"黄文仪","text":"剀切详明疏，尤传罪己篇。\n莫将轻进议，漫自訾前贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3717,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十六","author":"黄文仪","text":"学探贤圣域，秀节更能贞。\n天盖楼前月，长悬一片明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3718,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十七","author":"黄文仪","text":"紫阳真老宿，晚景造幽源。\n感兴斋居句，悔教枝叶繁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3719,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十八","author":"黄文仪","text":"山斗文章重，渊源出子舆。\n遗文盈箧笋，原道一篇书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3720,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其十九","author":"黄文仪","text":"三读复性书，艰深亦颇解。\n感化策前修，一息勤无懈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3721,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其二十","author":"黄文仪","text":"夏峰孙老人，讲学篡宗传。\n谢却蒲车诏，岁寒节益见。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3722,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其二十一","author":"黄文仪","text":"超超陶靖节，松柏岁寒心。\n载咏南山句，孔颜乐趣深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3723,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其二十二","author":"黄文仪","text":"安乐全高节，津桥听杜鹃。\n清风千古在，观物到先天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3724,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其二十三","author":"黄文仪","text":"洒落心无累，光风霁月天。\n画图明太极，雅爱一溪莲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3725,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其二十四","author":"黄文仪","text":"一介书生耳，犹留发几茎。\n典型仍未坠，夕照晓村明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3726,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其一","author":"黄文仪","text":"知音千古本来稀，老我空山乐茹薇。\n鸟入松云深得所，鹤盘海屿倦来归。\n一潭活水秋垂钓，半榻春风夜理徽。\n最是可人枝上蝶，南园草绿故飞飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3727,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其二","author":"黄文仪","text":"春风秋月足怡情，静里频敲磬几声。\n鸟语喃喃亲睡觉，花香脉脉梦魂清。\n无穷诗思云千叠，洗濯尘襟水一泓。\n万虑俱空缘不起，掩关终日听涛鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3728,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其三","author":"黄文仪","text":"结想名山静里天，身閒无事日如年。\n鸟啼花落云生石，水净沙明月印川。\n泛泛小舟红蓼渚，行行拄杖白云边。\n安居如此真吾乐，鸟弄歌笙当管弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3729,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄兴 其四","author":"黄文仪","text":"看破红尘淡外求，把将万事付东流。\n升沈有分情何著，俯仰无惭乐更优。\n茗椀薰炉供静趣，行云野鹤伴閒游。\n一丝不挂神超越，作德由来心日休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3730,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅","author":"黄文仪","text":"浅水晴沙外，烟笼一树梅。\n香浮风韵细，魂度月华来。\n半点无尘到，疏枝带雪开。\n琴心如可写，清梦共徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3731,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]